      "message": "Add semester model and scope points to a semester.\n\nSchema changes only.\n\nIncludes new semester table, a points semester_id FK, backfilled points to Fall 2026 via migration.\n\nMembers has a removed_at column for a soft-remove.\n\nPoint model assigns appsetting current semester for all point creation calls.\n\nSeeds set the current semester, find_or_create_by prevents dupes. rails_helper seeds a test semester so points can be created in tests.",
