      "message": "Add remove and restore member actions.\n\nAdmins can soft-remove memebers via removed_at, no row destructions.\n\nMembers index filters to active only and shows a removed-members section (collapsed) with restore buttons.\n\nAdmins table also filtered to active only.\n\nSafeguards: No self-removal, or manager removal.\n\nRequest specs cover auth, safeguards, and both restore/remove flows.",
