        "date": "2026-10-11T05:06:30Z"
      },
      "message": "Added reset semester feature with paginated semester views.\n\nAdmins can reset the semester via button on the members index. Action refuses to run while current semester is active, otherwise creates next term (Spring/Summer/Fall) and points the appsetting current semester to it.\n\nMember points totals will show 0 once appsetting current semester is the new semester. No real data is modified so data is preserved and viewable via/semesters.\n\nAdds /semesters (lsit of all semesters with total points awared) and /semesters/:id detail (total points per member per semester) using Pagy.\n\nSemester model sequence-based naming prevents collisions across repeated resets.\n\nRequest spec tests cover auth, active-semester guards, successful resets, and preservation of existing point rows.",
